@ReactionChemistry.Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135

GET {{ReactionChemistry.Backend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar URL temporária para upload de build
POST {{ReactionChemistry.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Upload/presign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "ReactionChemistry_Windows.zip",
  "platform": "PC Windows"
}

### Preparar URL de download para um build específico (substitua o ID e a chave)
GET {{ReactionChemistry.Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Download/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000?key=builds/arquivo.zip
Accept: application/json
